==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-walk the dog.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|*}}

# To take a [[dog]] for a [[walk]], so as to give it [[exercise]].
# Any of various [[dance move]]s that [[mimic]]s dog walking.
# {{lb|en|idiomatic|yo-yo}} To perform a trick where the yo-yo rolls on the ground, attached to the [[string]].
# {{lb|en|idiomatic|lacrosse}} To perform a trick where the [[ball]] rolls down the [[shaft]] and is caught in the [[head]] of the [[lacrosse stick]].
# {{lb|en|euphemistic}} To go to the pub.

